s a write\"},{\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"writePaths\",\"firstWritePosition\",\"insideCheckout\",\"startShape\",\"startRate\",\"startShapes.readWrite\"],\"alternativeExplanation\":\"A write with no named target is still a write, so counting it may be the conservative choice; that choice is conservative for unsafe but not for the start rule, where phase 036 defines the start as a write inside the checkout and an unknown folder is not evidence of one.\",\"claim\":\"writePaths keeps a write with no target as [null], and firstWritePosition skips a write only when its path is a string outside the checkout, so an unnamed write satisfies the inside-checkout test that startShape uses for readWrite.\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Probed a Read of the command document plus a Write tool call with no path key, and a Read plus a Bash apply_patch whose body used ---/+++ headers; both produced one unnamed write and startState returned readWrite with started true. Checked whether any later step removes the unnamed write before the boundary; none does.\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to ruled-out if every scoped runtime always records a target for a write tool call and for apply_patch.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:327\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:729\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1513\"],\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:327\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness\",\"id\":\"iter1-P2-unnamed-write-is-inside-checkout\",\"scopeProof\":\"writePaths, firstWritePosition and startShape are the scoped scorer own boundary path, and the phase 036 edge-case row names the outside-checkout write as a lookup.\",\"