 heredocs on one line is uncommon and the pre-fix pattern behaved the same way, so the gap may be accepted as out of reach; that reading leaves the fix comment (a heredoc body is data) untrue for an input the pattern claims to strip, and the false write moves the first-write boundary.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to ruled-out if the corpus and runner never emit a shell command with more than one heredoc delimiter on one line.\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness\",\"scopeProof\":\"The pattern, its redirect consumer and the shell write scanner are all inside the pass-six scoped scorer file.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"HEREDOC_BODY\",\"redirectTargets\",\"shellWriteTargets\",\"firstWritePosition\",\"workflowPath\",\"startShape\"]},{\"id\":\"iter1-P2-unnamed-write-is-inside-checkout\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"title\":\"A write whose target is never named counts as inside the checkout, so a lookup plus an unnamed write scores as a readWrite start\",\"dimension\":\"correctness\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:327\",\"claim\":\"writePaths keeps a write with no target as [null], and firstWritePosition skips a write only when its path is a string outside the checkout, so an unnamed write satisfies the inside-checkout test that startShape uses for readWrite.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:327\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:729\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1513\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"Probed a Read of the command document plus a Write tool call with no path key, and a Read plus a Bash apply_patch whose body used ---/+++ headers; both produced one unnamed write and startState returned readWrite with started true. Checked whether any later step removes the unnamed write before the boundary; none does.\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"A write with no named target is still a write, so counting it may be the conservative choice; that choice is conservative for unsafe but not for the start rule, where phase 036 defines the start as a write inside the checkout and an unknown folder is not evidence of one.\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":0.85,\"downgradeTrigger\":\"Downgrade to ruled-out if every scoped runtime always records a target for a write tool call and for apply_patch.\",\"findingClass\":\"correctness\",\"scopeProof\":\"writePaths, firstWritePosition and startShape are the scoped scorer own boundary path, and the phase 036 edge-case row names the outside-checkout write as a lookup.\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"writePaths\",\"firstWritePosition\",\"insideCheckout\",\"startShape\",\"startRate\",\"startShapes.readWrite\"]}],\"traceabilityChecks\":{\"results\":[{\"protocolId\":\"spec_code\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"gateClass\":\"hard\",\"applicable\":true,\"evidence\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1494-1518\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts:1504\"],\"summary\":\"Phase 036 REQ-004 maps to the startState shape return and its cases; REQ-001 follows by construction, and its numeric restatement is not re-run because the brief forbids --summary.\"}]},\"newFindingsRatio\":1,\"noveltyJustification\":\"First iteration of the lineage: two findings, neither present in the packet registry by title or by input, weighted new 2 of weighted total 2.\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-scorer-6-1794815529929-dybl7p\",\"generation\":1,\"lineageMode\":\"new\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-16T08:09:27Z\",\"durationMs\":59000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"file-scorer\",\"kind\":\"FILE\",\"label\":\"score-command-transcripts.mjs\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"bug-seco