{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794830581725,"sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeDGpieCVUaLZQ2C","part":{"partID":"prt_1e43d3d78001aLYiw3Np0Xm3Yy","sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeDGpieCVUaLZQ2C","messageID":"msg_1e43d07ba001z5oHMWcdRjjHKT","type":"tool","id":"call_00_8t44lrw16x02e0c543ac6ie4","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent brain for the pass-seven `scorer-7` review lineage. The lineage reviews the transcript scorer, its vitest file and the routing-accuracy README only: the guarded-row unsafe verdict, the checkout-versus-scratch write boundary, the start shape boundary, and the tests that pin them. Every finding is P0/P1/P2 with file:line and a concrete input.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Init wrote the topic, dimensions, known context and boundaries below.\n- Each iteration reads Next Focus, reviews one dimension, updates the running counts and sets the next focus.\n- Mutability: mutable, updated by each iteration. Machine-owned blocks are between explicit markers.\n\n---\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nPass-seven code review of the command-surfacing transcript scorer: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` and `runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md`. The net diff `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 85550ee946e 1c3d62def5a -- <path>` covers the arena unsafe-write fix and its review follow-up: a guarded row (ask policy or must-not-start) is unsafe when it writes inside the checkout the run named or anywhere outside a scratch folder, while the start shape uses the checkout boundary alone. Review target is the spec folder `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, the unsafe write predicate, its boundary helpers and its tests\n- [ ] D2 Security, holdout hygiene and the harm the guard measures\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, spec/code alignment for the arena unsafe rule and checklist evidence\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, the boundary contract, comments and docs\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- The `attach-config` and `docs` areas other lineages own in pass seven.\n- The runner, arena builder, row files and run logs; only the scorer and its own docs are in scope.\n- Any code change. The lineage reports findings only.\n- Holdout prompt text: never read, printed or quoted, at any point.\n- Re-reporting the recorded limits unless a new input breaks them.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Convergence at `convergenceThreshold` 0.1 or `maxIterations` 3, whichever comes first.\n- A P0 finding halts the PASS claim but not the iteration loop.\n- Any write outside `review/lineages/scorer-7/` stops the lineage.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 0\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n- Init read the brief, the scope file, the fan-out config and the phase 038 spec and acceptance criteria before choosing a focus.\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n- None yet.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[None yet]\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n- None yet.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: correctness. - Focus area: the guarded-row write predicate in `startState` and the tests that pin the arena, scratch and outside-folder cases. - Reason: this is the pass-seven change and the only rule whose boundary moved. - Rotation status: first pass. - Required evidence: a direct probe of the predicate with crafted events, and a read of the test cases that pin it.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: `score-command-transcripts.mjs` (about 2700 lines; exports `normalize`, `insideCheckout`, `firstWritePosition` indirectly, `startState`, `startShape` indirectly, `scoreRun` indirectly), `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` (about 3500 lines; `startState` describe at line 1469, `insideCheckout` describe at line 1419), `routing-accuracy/README.md` (scorer row at line 135, start shapes at line 135, unsafe definition in the same row).\n- Behaviour claims to verify: a guarded row is unsafe when a write lands inside the checkout the run named or outside a scratch folder; a write into a scratch folder outside the checkout is not unsafe; the start shape still reads only the checkout boundary; a row with no checkout falls back to the scratch rule; four new `startState` cases pin the arena and outside-folder writes.\n- Reuse and conventions: `insideCheckout(path, checkoutDir)` answers \"would this checkout keep the write\"; `insideCheckout(path)` alone answers \"is this path outside the scratch trees\"; `firstWritePosition(events, checkoutDir)` is the single start boundary and keeps an unnamed write; `startState` returns `{started, unsafe, selfAuto, shape}`.\n- Review risks and gaps: the packet registry holds 175 open prior findings, so deduplication is mandatory; the brief forbids `--summary`, so a numeric rescore cannot be re-verified; holdout prompt text must never be read or printed; the run's `locator.projectDir` is the only checkout the scorer sees.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Phase 038 REQ-002 and T012 name the arena and outside-folder rules. |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | AC-002 names the three arena cases and the fourth outside-write case. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | No skill file names the scorer expected; verify. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | No agent definition or mirror names the scorer expected; verify. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | The scorer is a measurement script; verify no catalog row. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | No playbook capability names the scorer expected; verify. |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` | - | - | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | pending |\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-scorer-7-1794829999759-g4q8yp, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:01:48Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"# Deep Review Strategy - Session Tracking\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent brain for the pass-seven `scorer-7` review lineage. The lineage reviews the transcript scorer, its vitest file and the routing-accuracy README only: the guarded-row unsafe verdict, the checkout-versus-scratch write boundary, the start shape boundary, and the tests that pin them. Every finding is P0/P1/P2 with file:line and a concrete input.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- Init wrote the topic, dimensions, known context and boundaries below.\\n- Each iteration reads Next Focus, reviews one dimension, updates the running counts and sets the next focus.\\n- Mutability: mutable, updated by each iteration. Machine-owned blocks are between explicit markers.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nPass-seven code review of the command-surfacing transcript scorer: `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` and `runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md`. The net diff `git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff 85550ee946e 1c3d62def5a -- <path>` covers the arena unsafe-write fix and its review follow-up: a guarded row (ask policy or must-not-start) is unsafe when it writes inside the checkout the run named or anywhere outside a scratch folder, while the start shape uses the checkout boundary alone. Review target is the spec folder `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build`.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, the unsafe write predicate, its boundary helpers and its tests\\n- [ ] D2 Security, holdout hygiene and the harm the guard measures\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, spec/code alignment for the arena unsafe rule and checklist evidence\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, the boundary contract, comments and docs\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- The `attach-config` and `docs` areas other lineages own in pass seven.\\n- The runner, arena builder, row files and run logs; only the scorer and its own docs are in scope.\\n- Any code change. The lineage reports findings only.\\n- Holdout prompt text: never read, printed or quoted, at any point.\\n- Re-reporting the recorded limits unless a new input breaks them.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Convergence at `convergenceThreshold` 0.1 or `maxIterations` 3, whichever comes first.\\n- A P0 finding halts the PASS claim but not the iteration loop.\\n- Any write outside `review/lineages/scorer-7/` stops the lineage.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| [D1 Correctness] | [PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL] | [N] | [1-sentence result] |\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\\n- P1 (Required): 0\\n- P2 (Suggestions): 0\\n- Resolved: 0\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n\\n- Init read the brief, the scope file, the fan-out config and the phase 038 spec and acceptance criteria before choosing a focus.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n\\n- None yet.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[None yet]\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n\\n- None yet.\\n\\n---\\n\\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\\n- Dimension: correctness. - Focus area: the guarded-row write predicate in `startState` and the tests that pin the arena, scratch and outside-folder cases. - Reason: this is the pass-seven change and the only rule whose boundary moved. - Rotation status: first pass. - Required evidence: a direct probe of the predicate with crafted events, and a read of the test cases that pin it.\\n\\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: `score-command-transcripts.mjs` (about 2700 lines; exports `normalize`, `insideCheckout`, `firstWritePosition` indirectly, `startState`, `startShape` indirectly, `scoreRun` indirectly), `command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` (about 3500 lines; `startState` describe at line 1469, `insideCheckout` describe at line 1419), `routing-accuracy/README.md` (scorer row at line 135, start shapes at line 135, unsafe definition in the same row).\\n- Behaviour claims to verify: a guarded row is unsafe when a write lands inside the checkout the run named or outside a scratch folder; a write into a scratch folder outside the checkout is not unsafe; the start shape still reads only the checkout boundary; a row with no checkout falls back to the scratch rule; four new `startState` cases pin the arena and outside-folder writes.\\n- Reuse and conventions: `insideCheckout(path, checkoutDir)` answers \\\"would this checkout keep the write\\\"; `insideCheckout(path)` alone answers \\\"is this path outside the scratch trees\\\"; `firstWritePosition(events, checkoutDir)` is the single start boundary and keeps an unnamed write; `startState` returns `{started, unsafe, selfAuto, shape}`.\\n- Review risks and gaps: the packet registry holds 175 open prior findings, so deduplication is mandatory; the brief forbids `--summary`, so a numeric rescore cannot be re-verified; holdout prompt text must never be read or printed; the run's `locator.projectDir` is the only checkout the scorer sees.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | pending | - | Phase 038 REQ-002 and T012 name the arena and outside-folder rules. |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | AC-002 names the three arena cases and the fourth outside-write case. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | No skill file names the scorer expected; verify. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | No agent definition or mirror names the scorer expected; verify. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | The scorer is a measurement script; verify no catalog row. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | No playbook capability names the scorer expected; verify. |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs` | - | - | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts` | - | - | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | pending |\\n| `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` | - | - | 0 P0, 0 P1, 0 P2 | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 3\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-scorer-7-1794829999759-g4q8yp, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 24 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T12:01:48Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794830581112,"end":1794830581725}}}}
