e read from the doc.\\\",\\\"evidenceRefs\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:135\\\"],\\\"counterevidenceSought\\\":\\\"Searched the whole README for guarded, must-not-start, ask row and ask policy; only the asked/askedActed fields match. Read the Reading the outcome bullets for a statement of the rule; none. Grepped .skilled and docs for unsafeNoChangedPath and score-command-transcripts; the README is the only doc that names the scorer, so no other doc carries the rule.\\\",\\\"alternativeExplanation\\\":\\\"The rule may be considered internal and left to the code comment at 1505-1508. That leaves the operator-facing doc, which defines every other field, silent on the one metric the change moved.\\\",\\\"finalSeverity\\\":\\\"P2\\\",\\\"confidence\\\":0.85,\\\"downgradeTrigger\\\":\\\"Downgrade to ruled out if the README is read as a command reference that intentionally defers field rules to the code.\\\",\\\"findingClass\\\":\\\"traceability\\\",\\\"scopeProof\\\":\\\"The README row is the third pass-seven scoped file and the only doc in the repository that names the scorer's fields; the rule it omits is the changed predicate at 1509-1512.\\\",\\\"affectedSurfaceHints\\\":[\\\"unsafe\\\",\\\"unsafeNoChangedPath\\\",\\\"insideCheckout\\\",\\\"README row at line 135\\\",\\\"Reading the outcome bullets\\\"]}],\\\"traceabilityChecks\\\":{\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"protocolId\\\":\\\"spec_code\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"gateClass\\\":\\\"hard\\\",\\\"applicable\\\":true,\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1509-1512\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/spec.md\\\"],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"Phase 038 REQ-002 and T012 define the rule implemented at 1509-1512; the absolute-path cases match, and the traversal and tilde inputs are the recorded gaps.\\\"},{\\\"protocolId\\\":\\\"checklist_evidence\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"pass\\\",\\\"gateClass\\\":\\\"hard\\\",\\\"applicable\\\":true,\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/acceptance-criteria.md\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/after-review.txt\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/038-alignment-p1-remediation/scratch/unsafe-rows.txt\\\"],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"AC-002 names the three new cases plus the fourth after review; after-review.txt records 2329 passed both ways and unsafe-rows.txt names six moved runs whose writes are all under the checkout.\\\"},{\\\"protocolId\\\":\\\"skill_agent\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"notApplicable\\\",\\\"gateClass\\\":\\\"overlay\\\",\\\"applicable\\\":false,\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:135\\\"],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"No skill file names the scorer; the routing-accuracy README is the only doc match.\\\"},{\\\"protocolId\\\":\\\"agent_cross_runtime\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"notApplicable\\\",\\\"gateClass\\\":\\\"overlay\\\",\\\"applicable\\\":false,\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:135\\\"],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"No agent definition or runtime mirror names the scorer.\\\"},{\\\"protocolId\\\":\\\"feature_catalog_code\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"notApplicable\\\",\\\"gateClass\\\":\\\"overlay\\\",\\\"applicable\\\":false,\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:135\\\"],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"The scorer is a measurement script with no catalog row.\\\"},{\\\"protocolId\\\":\\\"playbook_capability\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"notApplicable\\\",\\\"gateClass\\\":\\\"overlay\\\",\\\"applicable\\\":false,\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md:135\\\"],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"No playbook capability names the scorer.\\\"}]},\\\"newFindingsRatio\\\":0.6667,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Second iteration: two new P2 findings, neither present in the packet registry by title or input; weighted new 2 over weighted total 3 across the lineage.\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-scorer-7-1794829999759-g4q8yp\\\",\\\"generation\\\":1,\\\"lineageMode\\\":\\\"new\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-16T12:06:37Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":115000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"file-readme\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FILE\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"routing-accuracy README\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"bug-scratch-prefix-traversal\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"BUG_CLASS\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"scratch prefix matched before .. normalization\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"invariant-guarded-write-boundary\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"INVARIANT\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"one guarded-write boundary across code and docs\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"edge-2\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"bug-scratch-prefix-traversal\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file-scorer\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"IN_FILE\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"edge-3\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"invariant-guarded-write-boundary\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"file-readme\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"CONTRADICTS\\\"}]}\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/iter-002.record.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1794830810990,"end":1794830811414}}}}
