{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794830841225,"sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeDGpieCVUaLZQ2C","part":{"partID":"prt_1e441351200185K4go8Zajlrk0","sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeDGpieCVUaLZQ2C","messageID":"msg_1e4410d62001FZQCJe52Cmq2BF","type":"tool","id":"call_02_51o5l4mlexds0qgyzb8h4i7r","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pass | 2 | AC-002 names the three arena cases and the fourth outside-write case; `scratch/after-review.txt` records 2329 passed both ways and `unsafe-rows.txt` names six moved runs, all writing under `<checkout>`. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | No skill file names the scorer; the routing-accuracy README is the only doc match. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | No agent definition or runtime mirror names the scorer. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | The scorer is a measurement script with no catalog row. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | No playbook capability names the scorer. |","oldString":"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | AC-002 names the three arena cases and the fourth outside-write case. |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | No skill file names the scorer expected; verify. |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | No agent definition or mirror names the scorer expected; verify. |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | The scorer is a measurement script; verify no catalog row. |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | No playbook capability names the scorer expected; verify. |","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-