inition or runtime mirror names the scorer. |\n+| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | The scorer is a measurement script with no catalog row. |\n+| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | No playbook capability names the scorer. |\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ---\n \n","status":"modified","additions":5,"deletions":5}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pass | 2 | AC-002 names the three arena cases and the fourth outside-write case; `scratch/after-review.txt` records 2329 passed both ways and `unsafe-rows.txt` names six moved runs, all writing under `<checkout>`. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | No skill file names the scorer; the routing-accuracy README is the only doc match. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | No agent definition or runtime mirror names the scorer. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | The scorer is a measurement script with no catalog row. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | notApplicable | 2 | No playbook capability names the scorer. |\", \"oldString\": \"| `checklist_evidence` | core | pending | - | AC-002 names the three arena cases and the fourth outside-write case. |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | pending | - | No skill file names the scorer expected; verify. |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | pending | - | No agent definition or mirror names the scorer expected; verify. |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | pending | - | The scorer is a measurement script; verify no catalog row. |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | pending | - | No playbook capability names the scorer expected; verify. |\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/r