{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794830956540,"sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeDGpieCVUaLZQ2C","part":{"partID":"prt_1e442f71b001qnQTLEZwr1ZHTn","sessionID":"ses_e1bcb8a74ffeDGpieCVUaLZQ2C","messageID":"msg_1e442dca9001rk3ADfRVXkrw0A","type":"tool","id":"call_01_r5y44jsigbi7pdphhmp6xtgh","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- Expecting the scratch prefix test to resolve a `..` segment: `/tmp/../Users/dev/repo/x.md` keeps the `/tmp/` prefix and is exempted, though it resolves to a real folder (iteration 2).\n- Expecting the README row to state the guarded-write rule: it defines every other field but only names the loop-without-init case, while its outside-write sentence says such a write sets no boundary (iteration 2).\n- Expecting the declared return type to be the only contract a maintainer needs: the same helper name answers the checkout question and the scratch question on one line, which is how the pre-fix line lost the checkout (iteration 3).","oldString":"- Expecting the scratch prefix test to resolve a `..` segment: `/tmp/../Users/dev/repo/x.md` keeps the `/tmp/` prefix and is exempted, though it resolves to a real folder (iteration 2).\n- Expecting the README row to state the guarded-write rule: it defines every other field but only names the loop-without-init case, while its outside-write sentence says such a write sets no boundary (iteration 2).","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-7/deep-re